# Copy this file to pnpki-trust-bundle.pem and paste PNPKI trusted CA certs in PEM format.
# Include one or more trusted root/intermediate CA certificates used to validate signer cert chains.
# Example format:
# -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
# MIIF....
# -----END CERTIFICATE-----
# -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
# MIIG....
# -----END CERTIFICATE-----
